title: 'High-Frequency WebSocket Updates in React Without Re-Renders'
description:
  'A 300ms price feed re-rendering your whole dashboard? You do not need Redux, Zustand, or Jotai to
  fix it. React already ships with everything you need: refs, useSyncExternalStore, and a bit of
  discipline about what belongs in React state.'
